{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roboholic is a unique roguelite first-person shooter where a beer-brewing robot takes matters into its metallic hands. Use deadly &quot;alco-guns,&quot; experiment with insane implants, and race through levels, leaving nothing but chaos in your wake. Build your beer empire and revel in the madness of a world where retro-futuristic style meets epic battles! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO OBSTACLES CAN STAND IN YOUR WAY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the destructible environment as a weapon and change your strategy on the fly. Reduce levels to rubble and find innovative ways to annihilate your enemies.  <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/72f31946c0e32e96ea8fd2f7ca40bec2.poster.avif?t=1760514338\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/72f31946c0e32e96ea8fd2f7ca40bec2.webm?t=1760514338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/72f31946c0e32e96ea8fd2f7ca40bec2.mp4?t=1760514338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR OWN COMBAT STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a massive arsenal of unusual weapons with unique effects. Every weapon brings something special to the battlefield, turning every fight into a dazzling spectacle.\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/9fe2bda079c290af5678f8cea8ae0c3d.poster.avif?t=1760514338\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/9fe2bda079c290af5678f8cea8ae0c3d.webm?t=1760514338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/9fe2bda079c290af5678f8cea8ae0c3d.mp4?t=1760514338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACHIEVE ENGINEERING PERFECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your robot with experimental implants. Unlock new abilities and obliterate your foes with even greater power and flair. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/e51f80f8b0a8179bad23dd6cdb7b8d5d.poster.avif?t=1760514338\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/e51f80f8b0a8179bad23dd6cdb7b8d5d.webm?t=1760514338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/e51f80f8b0a8179bad23dd6cdb7b8d5d.mp4?t=1760514338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSE YOURSELF IN THE CHARM OF RETRO-FUTURISM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mesmerizing landscapes of a strange planet, marvel at stylish levels, and soak in an atmosphere inspired by the futuristic dreams of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/78501dff551be405a25c384a78c1328e.poster.avif?t=1760514338\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/78501dff551be405a25c384a78c1328e.webm?t=1760514338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/78501dff551be405a25c384a78c1328e.mp4?t=1760514338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew, blast, and upgrade your way through a retro-futuristic world gone mad!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/690210?t=1760514338","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760514338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760514338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760514338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Have some alcohol thematics in game - weapons firing with beer.\r\nAlso player building it own bar in the hub."},"demos":[{"appid":690230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roboholic is a unique roguelite first-person shooter where a beer-brewing robot takes matters into its metallic hands. Use deadly &quot;alco-guns,&quot; experiment with insane implants, and race through levels, leaving nothing but chaos in your wake. Build your beer empire and revel in the madness of a world where retro-futuristic style meets epic battles! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO OBSTACLES CAN STAND IN YOUR WAY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the destructible environment as a weapon and change your strategy on the fly. Reduce levels to rubble and find innovative ways to annihilate your enemies.  <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/690210/extras/72f31946c0e32e96ea8fd2f7ca40bec2.poster.avif?t=1760514338\" width=544 height=306 ><sou